abstract: >-
  Exposition-revised manuscript and Supplement sources, Lean 4 formalization,
  exact-search programs, construction verifiers, certificate generators, CNF
  instances, DRAT proofs, verification scripts, manifests, checksums, tests,
  and locked dependency metadata supporting the exact eventual saturated 6-
  and 7-Sperner numbers.
